title: "Arithmetic Spectral Descent"
abstract: "Obstruction Theory, Hodge–Krein Realization, and a Falsifiable Architecture for the Riemann Hypothesis. A monograph in four volumes bound as one, a self-contained research subject of the Grothendieckian Programme: obstruction theory for the Riemann Hypothesis, a proved conditional derivation from three unconstructed realization hypotheses, and the obligations that remain. The Riemann Hypothesis remains open."
